<title>TURKEY: Turkey's ruling Islamists see October elections.</title>
<headline>Turkey's ruling Islamists see October elections.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A senior member of Turkey's ruling Islamist Welfare Party said on Wednesday elections were expected to take place in October to solve a growing row between the coalition and the secularist establishment.</p>
<p>&quot;During this month the election decision will be made by parliament and elections will probably take place in October,&quot; Welfare deputy Temel Karamollaoglu told a news conference.</p>
</text>
